.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt MV 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm mv
.Nd move or rename files
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar source target
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility renames
.Ar source
to
.Ar target .
If
.Ar target
is an existing directory, the source is moved below it using its final path component.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr cp 1 ,
.Xr rm 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
